9e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Container"><items count="8"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">f9b71076-beb2-4cdb-8f59-eb8d6f458987</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10"></item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">KOLUMBA ART MUSEUM · Cologne, Germany, 2007
Architect: Peter Zumthor. Bricks: Petersen Tegl, handmade, about 528 × 108 × 37 mm.

Long thin grey bricks; above the ruins the wall becomes a "filter wall" with small gaps between bricks,
so light and air pass into the hall. Here: a solid base, and above it the same long brick laid with 70 mm open
head joints, half-bond, so every course is a row of small openings.
A study of the idea, not a copy. All credit for the design belongs to its authors. Units: metres.</item></items><chunks count="2"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="5"><item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35"><X>40</X><Y>20</Y><W>700</W><H>140</H></item><item name="MarginLeft" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="MarginRight" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="MarginTop" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31"><X>390.0</X><Y>90.0</Y></item></items></chunk><chunk name="PanelProperties"><items count="7"><item name="Colour" type_name="gh_drawing_color" type_code="36"><ARGB>255;255;250;90</ARGB></item><item name="DrawIndices" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="DrawPaths" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="Multiline" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="SpecialCodes" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Stream" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Wrap" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item></items></chunk></chunks></chunk></chunks></chunk><chunk name="Object" index="1"><items count="2"><item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">fbac3e32-f100-4292-8692-77240a42fd1a</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Point</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Container"><items count="6"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Contains a collection of three-dimensional points</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">9b4c59a1-7c9c-4adc-bd84-57ca5c12c65c</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Point</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Pt</item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item></items><chunks count="2"><chunk